## 📝 API Testing (Port 5021)

### Create a Blog Post

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5021/api/blogs \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "title": "My First Post",
    "description": "A test post",
    "content": "This is the content",
    "author": "Your Name",
    "category": "Tutorial",
    "tags": "test,freelang",
    "slug": "first-post",
    "featured": false
  }'
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "My First Post",
  "createdAt": 1773322187975,
  "viewCount": 0,
  "likes": 0,
  ...
}
```

### List All Posts

```bash
curl http://localhost:5021/api/blogs
```

### Get Specific Post

```bash
curl http://localhost:5021/api/blogs/1
```

### Increment Views

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5021/api/blogs/1/view
```

### Add Like

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5021/api/blogs/1/like
```

### Update Post

```bash
curl -X PUT http://localhost:5021/api/blogs/1 \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "status": "published",
    "isDraft": false
  }'
```

### Delete Post

```bash
curl -X DELETE http://localhost:5021/api/blogs/1
```

