## 🔧 Configuration

### Port Selection

The server uses the `PORT` environment variable:

```bash
# Default: 5021
PORT=5021 node blog-server.js

# Custom port
PORT=8080 node blog-server.js

# From environment
export PORT=5021
node blog-server.js
```

### Database Location

Default: `/tmp/blog-data.json`

```bash
# In blog-server.js, change:
const db = new BlogDatabase('/tmp/blog-data.json');

# Or use environment variable (requires modification)
```

