## 📊 Running Server Status

```bash
# Check if server is running
curl -s http://localhost:5021/api/blogs | python3 -m json.tool

# Monitor in real-time
watch -n 1 'curl -s http://localhost:5021/api/blogs | wc -l'

# View database file
cat /tmp/blog-data.json | python3 -m json.tool

# Stop server
kill $(cat /tmp/blog-server.pid)
```

