## 📈 Load Testing (Port 5021)

### Simple Load Test

```bash
#!/bin/bash
for i in {1..10}; do
  curl -X POST http://localhost:5021/api/blogs \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d "{
      \"title\": \"Post $i\",
      \"author\": \"Tester\",
      \"content\": \"Test\",
      \"category\": \"Test\",
      \"tags\": \"load-test\",
      \"slug\": \"post-$i\"
    }" &
done
wait
echo "✅ Created 10 posts"
```

### Performance Verification

```bash
# Measure response time
time curl http://localhost:5021/api/blogs

# Get total posts count
curl -s http://localhost:5021/api/blogs | wc -l

# Monitor system resources
top -p $(cat /tmp/blog-server.pid)
```

