## 🚨 Troubleshooting

### Port Already in Use

```bash
# Find what's using port 5021
lsof -i :5021

# Kill process using port
kill -9 <PID>
```

### Database File Issues

```bash
# View database
cat /tmp/blog-data.json

# Backup database
cp /tmp/blog-data.json /tmp/blog-data.json.backup

# Clear database (start fresh)
rm /tmp/blog-data.json
```

### Node.js Not Found

```bash
# Install Node.js if needed
which node

# Or use nvm to manage Node versions
```

